#Damage
Description
$n面露淡淡的微笑﹐柳腰一轉﹐一招$S『月兒倒鉤』$Z﹐不慌不忙的輕輕閃過$N的殺著。~
Chance          10
Value           20
Parry           0
Situs           ATTACK_RANDOM
Innate          0 0
End

#Damage
Description
